---
import { wa } from "../../data/site";
import DashboardMock from "../DashboardMock.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="aurora pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-[54rem]"></div>
  <div class="grid-lines pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-[42rem]"></div>

  <div class="container pt-16 text-center sm:pt-24">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      <span class="inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
      Seu time de crescimento sob demanda
    </span>

    <h1 class="title-h1 mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-ink">
      Estratégia e execução <span class="gradient-text">por nossa conta</span>.
      <span class="mt-2 block">Você só aprova e vê os resultados.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="lead mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl">
      A Zyra cuida do marketing, da aquisição e da operação necessária para
      acompanhar o crescimento da sua empresa, com uma estratégia feita para o
      seu negócio.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href={wa("Olá, quero meu diagnóstico gratuito com a Zyra.")} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">
        Quero meu diagnóstico gratuito
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#como-funciona" class="btn btn-secondary">Ver como funciona</a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-7 text-sm font-medium text-muted">
      Sem fidelidade<span class="mx-2 text-faint">·</span>A partir de R$ 550/mês<span class="mx-2 text-faint">·</span>CRM incluso
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container-wide relative mt-16 pb-20 sm:mt-20 sm:pb-28">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-0 -z-10 h-64 w-[52rem] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/35 via-accent-500/35 to-cyan-400/30 glow-lg"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-24 top-1/3 -z-10 h-64 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-400/20 via-brand-500/20 to-accent-500/20 glow-lg"></div>
    <div class="relative ring-gradient rounded-2xl">
      <span class="absolute -top-3 right-6 z-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface/90 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-muted shadow-[var(--shadow-xs)] backdrop-blur">
        Exemplo de acompanhamento
      </span>
      <DashboardMock />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
